    "No direct brain/plasma, CSF, or uptake measurement for the query molecule in the supplied evidence.",
    "All supplied permeable analogues are more lipophilic and lack the dicationic guanidine moiety; no analogue reproduces the query's charge state.",
    "No transporter (OCT/P-gp/BCRP) data for the query are provided."
  ],
